ne-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】ＡＮＡクラウンプラザホテル秋田　ｂｙ　ＩＨＧ の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"faq\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 my-8\">💡 秋田・乳頭温泉郷・角館・男鹿・玉川温泉旅行に関するよくある質問（FAQ）</h2>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-6\">\n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            東北三大祭りの一つ「秋田竿燈まつり（かんとう）」とは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 毎年8月3日〜6日に開催され、約280本もの提灯を下げた巨大な竿燈（重さ50kg）を差し手が額・腰・肩に乗せる妙技が圧巻の夏の風物詩です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            秋田の二大名物グルメ「きりたんぽ鍋」と「稲庭うどん」とは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 比内地鶏の出汁でゴボウ・セリ・マイタケと共に煮込む香ばしい『きりたんぽ鍋』と、300年の歴史を持つ手延べ製法のつるりとした喉越しが自慢の『稲庭うどん』です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            秋田市最大の歓楽街「川反（かわばた）」の歩き方は？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 旭川沿いに約400軒の居酒屋やバーが並ぶ東北有数のネオン街で、地酒（新政・雪の茅舎など）とハタハタやしょっつる鍋が楽しめます。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ あわせて読みたい！秋田県＆周辺エリアの厳選宿ガイド</h3>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <!-- 同一都道府県エリア特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-amber-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>📍</span> 秋田県のエリア別・後悔回避宿特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/akita-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】秋田おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">秋田県全域（乳頭温泉郷田沢湖角館・男鹿半島・秋田市街・八幡平玉川温泉湯沢）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/hachimantai-tamagawa-goshogake-yuzawa-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】八幡平・玉川温泉・湯沢おすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">仙北市北部・鹿角市・湯沢市（八幡平アスピーテライン・玉川温泉・後生掛温泉・秋ノ宮温泉郷・栗駒山）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/nyuto-onsen-tazawako-kakunodate-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】乳頭温泉郷・角館おすすめ高級宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">仙北市（乳頭温泉郷・田沢湖畔・田沢湖高原・角館武家屋敷通り・抱返り渓谷）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/oga-peninsula-namahage-onsen-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】男鹿半島おすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">男鹿市（男鹿温泉郷・入道崎・真山神社・なまはげ館・寒風山・ゴジラ岩）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 近隣・隣接都道府県の人気特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-orange-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>🚗</span> 周遊・隣接エリアのおすすめ特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/aomori-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【青森県】【2026年最新】青森おすすめホテル・温泉旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">青森県全域（奥入瀬渓流十和田湖・八甲田酸ヶ湯・弘前津軽・青森市街浅虫・八戸大間）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/iwate-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【岩手県】【2026年最新】岩手おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">岩手県全域（花巻温泉郷遠野・平泉一関・盛岡市街繋温泉雫石・三陸海岸宮古釜石）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/yamagata-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【山形県】【2026年最新】山形おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">山形県全域（銀山温泉・蔵王温泉・かみのやま・米沢・庄内鶴岡）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center border-t border-amber-200/60 mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n    <a href=\"/prefectures/features\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900 underline\">\n      🎌 全47都道府県の厳選特集一覧を見る →\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
}